  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Devastating Earthquake Hits Turkey and Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In February, a series of earthquakes, the most powerful 7.8 magnitude, hit Turkiye (also known as Turkey) near the border of Syria. Tens of thousands of people were killed, sending shockwaves across northern Syria and parts of Lebanon. Syria&apos;s health system is already strained beyond capacity due to conflict and a cholera outbreak. Our teams are working tirelessly to ensure the safety of those affected.</narrative>
  </description>
